# Idle: battery-9v (9.0 V EMF, 1.7 ohm R_int) feeds the Nano (~26 mA) and LM7805 + green LED
# (~18 mA), ~45 mA total, sagging ~0.08 V to ~8.92 V.
# With btn1 held, the 25 ohm load draws ~331 mA (~375 mA total, under the 500 mA rating),
# sagging the battery rail to ~8.36 V (0.56 V extra drop) while LM7805 holds 5.00 V.
open
step 100ms
expect @led1 lit
expect @bat.pos > 8.85V
expect @bat.pos < 8.98V
expect @reg.OUT > 4.95V
expect @reg.OUT < 5.05V
expect @nano.5V > 4.95V
expect serial contains "bat=8.9"
press @btn1
step 100ms
expect @bat.pos > 8.28V
expect @bat.pos < 8.44V
expect @reg.OUT > 4.95V
expect @reg.OUT < 5.05V
expect @led1 lit
expect serial contains "bat=8.3"
release @btn1
step 100ms
expect @bat.pos > 8.85V
expect no diagnostics
